{"id":"877e2f2a1b69f31b","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-lc-strong-compactness-filter.md","title":"ZFC LC Strong Compactness Filter","display":"df-zfc-lc-strong-compactness-filter — ZFC LC Strong Compactness Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-lc-strong-compactness-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-lc-strong-compactness-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-lc-strong-compactness-filter — ZFC LC Strong Compactness Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-lc-strong-compactness-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-lc-strong-compactness-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-lc-strong-compactness-filter — ZFC LC Strong Compactness Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56914510091eed27\" href=\"?note=56914510091eed27\" title=\"58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter\">58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,F,U\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,F,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S\\)</span> (kappa-complete-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"56914510091eed27\" href=\"?note=56914510091eed27\" title=\"58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter\">58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcStrongCompactnessFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcStrongCompactnessFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}strong\\text{-}compactness\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLcStrongCompactnessFilter}_S(F,U,\\kappa,\\lambda) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda\\mid |x|&lt;\\kappa\\},\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda\\mid |x|&lt;\\kappa\\land\\alpha\\in x\\}\\in F\\bigr)\\land F\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda\\mid |x|&lt;\\kappa\\})\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda\\mid |x|&lt;\\kappa\\},\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}strong\\text{-}compactness\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLcStrongCompactnessFilter}_S(F,U,\\kappa,\\lambda) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda\\mid |x|&lt;\\kappa\\},\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda\\mid |x|&lt;\\kappa\\land\\alpha\\in x\\}\\in F\\bigr)\\land F\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda\\mid |x|&lt;\\kappa\\})\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda\\mid |x|&lt;\\kappa\\},\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a fine <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete filter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\">\\(P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> is a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete ultrafilter extending it.</li>\n<li>Fineness and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\">\\(P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\\)</span> are expanded, replacing the unsourced <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fine}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fine}\\)</span> predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter","status":"resolved","id":"56914510091eed27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAncho